Online:Armor of the Code:
{{Trail|Sets}}{{Online Update|type=itemset}}{{Deprecated}}
'''Armor of the Code''' was an [[ON:Sets|item set]] found at one time in the data files, but which has since been disabled.  This was a craftable set, as attuned crafting stations for it can still be found in the game data, though there were never crafting stations available in the game, so attuning a station to them is impossible.  It's possible it was created only for testing purposes by the developers.  The unusual aspect of having the unique enchantment from just 1 item instead of all 5 suggests that this was never intended to be seen in the actual game.

===Bonuses===
<onlyinclude>
'''1 item''': Increase your [[Online:Weapon Critical (effect)|Critical Chance]] against targets with a lower % of health than you by 47-2051.<br>
'''2 items''': Adds {{ESO Magicka Link|25-1096 Maximum}}<br>
'''3 items''': Adds {{ESO Magicka Link|3-129|Recovery}}<br>
'''4 items''': Adds {{ESO Magicka Link|25-1096 Maximum}}
</onlyinclude>
