:''Carved from morpholith and crowned with a searing gem, this Daedric ring weighs heavy on the hand. All the malice of the Kyn dwells in its many loops—as does the glory of their warrior barons.''
'''Markyn Ring of Majesty''' is a [[ON:Mythic Items|{{ESO Quality Color|m|Mythic}}]] [[ON:Jewelry|ring]] that comes with the [[ON:Bloodthirsty|Bloodthirsty]] trait. It can be obtained through the [[ON:Antiquities|Antiquities]] system. It was released as part of the [[ON:The Deadlands (DLC)|Deadlands DLC]].

===Bonuses===
<onlyinclude>
'''1 item''': Gain 100 {{ESO Weapon Damage Link|||y}} and {{ESO Spell Damage Link}} and 1157 [[Online:Armor|Armor]] for every set you are wearing 3 or more pieces of. Current bonus: 0 {{ESO Weapon Damage Link|||y}} and {{ESO Spell Damage Link}} and 0 Armor.
</onlyinclude>

===Fragments===
* Five fragments are required to create the item, all of which require a [[ON:Antiquity Leads#Master|master-quality Lead]] in order to [[ON:Scrying|scry]], and are classed as [[ON:Excavation#Master|master difficulty]] to [[ON:Excavation|excavate]].
* You are required to be at least level 7 in [[ON:Scrying|Scrying]], and have the [[ON:Antiquarian Insight|Antiquarian Insight IV]] passive in order to scry Master difficulty leads.
* Fragment Leads are largely found in the same zone as where the fragment is excavated, save for a few cases where it may be found in different zone.

