Online:Perfected Puncturing Remedy:
{{Trail|Sets}}{{Online Update|type=itemset}}
'''Perfected Puncturing Remedy''' is a [[ON:Perfected Master's Weapons|Perfected Master's Weapons]] [[ON:Weapon Sets#Master's Weapons|item set]] found in veteran [[ON:Dragonstar Arena|Dragonstar Arena]]. It cannot be [[ON:Craftable Sets|crafted]]. The axe and dagger are in the [[ON:Khajiit Style|Khajiit Style]], the shield is in the [[ON:Dark Elf Style|Dark Elf Style]], the sword is in the [[ON:Nord Style|Nord Style]] and the mace is in the [[ON:Argonian Style|Argonian Style]], all of which are in the unobtainable tier 5 versions. The [[ON:Puncturing Remedy|non-perfected]] version of this set can be looted on normal difficulty.

===Bonuses===
<onlyinclude>
'''2 perfected items''': Adds 3% [[Online:Healing|Healing]] Taken<br>
'''2 items''': When you deal damage with [[Online:Puncture|Puncture]], you heal for {{ESO Health Link|2230}} and gain {{ESO Resistance Link|Spell|||y}} and {{ESO Resistance Link|Physical}} equal to the amount of healing or over healing done for 5 seconds. The healing scales off your {{ESO Health Link|Max}}.
</onlyinclude>
===Pieces===
The set consists of a [[ON:One Hand and Shield|one handed weapon and shield]] of all types.

===Notes===
* This set consists of a one-handed weapon and a shield, which must be equipped together.  You could in theory equip two one-handed weapons, but you cannot cast [[ON:Puncture|Puncture]] without a shield equipped.  However, if you have a one-hand and shield weapon on one slot, and a pair of weapons on the other slot, you might be able to benefit from the set while dual wielding.  (This would require receiving this set 3 times in order to have enough weapons.){{vn}}

