Online:Tide-Born Wildstalker:
{{Mod Header|2025 Content Pass}}{{Trail|Sets}}{{Online Update|type=itemset}}
'''Tide-Born Wildstalker''' is one of the [[ON:Craftable Sets|craftable sets]] providing special bonuses to [[ON:Armor|armor]] and [[ON:Weapons|weapons]]. It is available for [[ON:Crafting|crafting]] to players pursuing [[ON:Blacksmithing|blacksmithing]], [[ON:Clothing|clothing]], [[ON:Woodworking|woodworking]], and/or [[ON:Jewelry Crafting|jewelry crafting]] professions. The special crafting site with stations dedicated to the creation of this set is located at the [[ON:Tide-Born Foundry|Tide-Born Foundry]] in [[ON:Western Solstice|Western Solstice]].

To make an item for this set, a [[ON:Crafting|crafter]] must first complete [[ON:Traits#Research|research]] on '''five traits''' for that particular item at a corresponding crafting station.

===Bonuses===
<onlyinclude>
'''2 items''': Adds 3-129 {{ESO Weapon Damage Link|||y}} and {{ESO Spell Damage Link}}<br>
'''3 items''': Adds 15-657 [[Online:Weapon Critical (effect)|Critical Chance]]<br>
'''4 items''': Adds 34-1487 [[Online:Penetration|Offensive Penetration]]<br>
'''5 items''': Increase your direct damage done to [[Online:Monsters|monster]]s by 15%.
</onlyinclude>

